          "\\sum_{i \\in P} (Machine\_B\_Hours\_Req_i \\cdot x_i) \\le 6000",
          "\\sum_{i \\in P} (Labor\_Hours\_Req_i \\cdot x_i) \\le 10000",
          "\\sum_{i \\in P} (Raw\_Material\_Units\_Req_i \\cdot x_i) \\le 30000"
        ],
        "description": "Ensures that the total resource consumption for all products does not exceed the available capacity for each resource."
      },
      {
        "name": "Demand and Production Constraints",
        "formula": "Min\_Production\_Requirement_i \\le x_i \\le Max\_Market\_Demand_i \\quad \\forall i \\in P",
